%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:yousandi.cn,2023:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7670c36d54f344445b515211d15f7aed, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 279961600
    m_Localized: (By the barn wall, a short wooden ladder lies on its side,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961601
    m_Localized: "*hic\u2014*"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961602
    m_Localized: "Who\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961603
    m_Localized: "Mabel's egg is gone. Did you see anything?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961604
    m_Localized: "(Buster's ear twitches. His eyes slowly come into focus)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961605
    m_Localized: "The egg… Trinket… carried it off."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961606
    m_Localized: "Trinket?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961607
    m_Localized: "Mm… Trinket flew to the barn roof. I chased it, couldn't jump up, and bit a mouthful of air."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961608
    m_Localized: "(Buster lowers his head back onto his paws. His voice drops)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961609
    m_Localized: "I failed… I didn't protect Mabel's egg."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961610
    m_Localized: There's a short ladder under you. Can you shift over first?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961611
    m_Localized: "(Buster drowsily kicks. The ladder gets pinned even harder)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961612
    m_Localized: "\u2026Don't push\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961613
    m_Localized: "*hic\u2026*"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961614
    m_Localized: "Buster, drink this first."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961615
    m_Localized: "Buster, wake up."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961616
    m_Localized: I'll come back later.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961617
    m_Localized: "(Buster squints, leans in to sniff, sticks out his tongue and drinks slowly. He pauses, then buries his head and keeps drinking)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961618
    m_Localized: "(A moment later Buster flings his head — the wet leaf flies off his forehead)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961619
    m_Localized: "*urk\u2014*"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961620
    m_Localized: "(Buster blinks hard. His eyes start to focus)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961621
    m_Localized: (He pushes up off the ladder and stands, swaying)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961622
    m_Localized: "\u2026Mm. Clearer now."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961623
    m_Localized: "(Buster huffs and buries his head in his paws)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961624
    m_Localized: "*hic\u2026* quiet\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961625
    m_Localized: Calling won't wake him. I need something that can sober him up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961626
    m_Localized: Calling won't wake him. He has to sober up before I can borrow the
      ladder.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961627
    m_Localized: Anything else?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961628
    m_Localized: Can I borrow the ladder?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961629
    m_Localized: Whose nest is that in the barn?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961630
    m_Localized: Is this the egg you chased?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961631
    m_Localized: Nothing else for now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961632
    m_Localized: "Buster, can I borrow the ladder? I have to get over that little wall by the entrance."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961633
    m_Localized: The ladder?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961634
    m_Localized: "(Buster turns and looks at the fallen ladder beside him)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961635
    m_Localized: Oh. Right. Take it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961636
    m_Localized: "(Buster pushes the ladder this way with a paw)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961637
    m_Localized: Set it steady before you climb. Don't fall.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961638
    m_Localized: There's a flattened grass nest in the corner of the barn. Do you
      know whose it is?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961639
    m_Localized: That grass nest in the barn corner?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961640
    m_Localized: "(Buster frowns, trying to remember)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961641
    m_Localized: A couple of days ago I thought I saw two gray little things dart
      past. Too fast. Didn't see them clearly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961642
    m_Localized: Or maybe I was too drunk those days.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961643
    m_Localized: "Buster, look at this — is this the egg you chased that day?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961644
    m_Localized: "(Buster lowers his head and stares at the open notebook)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961645
    m_Localized: "This is\u2026 what?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961646
    m_Localized: "(Buster's eyes go wide. He leans closer)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961647
    m_Localized: A rock?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961648
    m_Localized: "(Buster lifts his head and freezes)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961649
    m_Localized: "…It's about the same shape as the thing Trinket carried off."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961650
    m_Localized: "Trinket has been guarding this rock. He says it's his tribe's totem gem."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961651
    m_Localized: "(Buster stares at the notebook, not moving)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961652
    m_Localized: "So what Trinket took… wasn't Mabel's egg?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961653
    m_Localized: "\u2026I\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961654
    m_Localized: Then I'm not a useless guard!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961655
    m_Localized: (His tail starts whipping and won't stop)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961656
    m_Localized: "Mabel's egg must still be out there!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961657
    m_Localized: "(Buster jolts and takes a deep breath)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961658
    m_Localized: (He stops facing one direction, solemn)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961659
    m_Localized: "The egg's scent is that way \u2014 the red-roof house. Where the
      owner lives. Across the bridge."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961660
    m_Localized: "(Buster stops outside the red-roof house, tail held tight)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961661
    m_Localized: Right here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961662
    m_Localized: Go look at that door first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961663
    m_Localized: Find anything?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961664
    m_Localized: Can't get in the front door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961665
    m_Localized: Are there other animals living in the red-roof house?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961666
    m_Localized: Nothing yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961667
    m_Localized: "\u2026Then what do we do. Detective, look again. I'll try in a
      bit too."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961668
    m_Localized: There's a fine little door here, and a tuft of animal fur,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961669
    m_Localized: "(Buster blinks, then smacks his forehead with a paw)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961670
    m_Localized: "Ow! This dog brain of mine \u2014 the drink still hasn't worn off!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961671
    m_Localized: What did you remember?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961672
    m_Localized: A cat! That arrogant black cat!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961673
    m_Localized: Where is he?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961674
    m_Localized: In the great oak!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961675
    m_Localized: (Both paws on the trunk, he shakes it hard)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961676
    m_Localized: Lord Cat! Come down! We need you on this!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961677
    m_Localized: "Buster, have you known that black cat a long time?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961678
    m_Localized: "Quite a while. When he first came\u2026 he was smaller than one
      of my paws."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961679
    m_Localized: "(Buster looks down at his own paw)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961680
    m_Localized: He didn't know anything then. Couldn't even climb a tree. I taught
      him once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961681
    m_Localized: Did he learn?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961682
    m_Localized: He did. After that he stopped talking to me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961683
    m_Localized: Was he afraid of anything as a kitten?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961684
    m_Localized: Rain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961685
    m_Localized: "(Buster scratches an ear)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961686
    m_Localized: I mentioned it later. He said he'd never been in my doghouse, that
      kind of place.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961687
    m_Localized: "(Buster looks toward where Velvet is crouched)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961688
    m_Localized: He's still there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961689
    m_Localized: What?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961690
    m_Localized: I said he hasn't left. Any other cat, shaken out of a tree, would've
      bolted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961691
    m_Localized: "(Buster casually shifts half a step aside)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961692
    m_Localized: He's listening. He just doesn't want anyone to notice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961693
    m_Localized: "(Buster sits by the oak, looking toward the red-roof house)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961694
    m_Localized: I'll keep watch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961695
    m_Localized: "(Buster looks up at the red roof, tail swaying gently)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961696
    m_Localized: Go on. I'll wait here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961697
    m_Localized: On patrol. All clear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961698
    m_Localized: "Buster, what happened to that rock in the end?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961699
    m_Localized: "Still with Trinket. I asked. It says it's a tribal totem gem. A big deal."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961700
    m_Localized: "(Buster scratches an ear)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961701
    m_Localized: "\u2026Let it be."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961702
    m_Localized: "I think\u2026 next time I see apple mash, I won't drink it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961703
    m_Localized: (A pause)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961704
    m_Localized: I'm a guard. Not a drunk.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961705
    m_Localized: "Buster, will another egg go missing?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961706
    m_Localized: No.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 279961707
    m_Localized: "(Buster looks down at his collar, then up)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155904
    m_Localized: My nose works just fine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155905
    m_Localized: Every time it thunders, he comes and crouches beside my doghouse.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155906
    m_Localized: I say come in. He says this cat is only passing by,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155907
    m_Localized: A big yellow dog half-sprawled on top of it, a low snore with a
      whistle)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155908
    m_Localized: Can't get over the low wall at the barn entrance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155909
    m_Localized: He has his own cat door. The key hangs on his neck!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155910
    m_Localized: Then he stood in the doorway the whole night.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155911
    m_Localized: That's just how he is. Mouth harder than stone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155912
    m_Localized: I'll go on ahead. See you past the bridge!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155913
    m_Localized: (The crown of the tree shakes hard. A black cat drops from it, fur
      exploded, eyes rolling)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155914
    m_Localized: "Get\u2014away!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155915
    m_Localized: Can't you see this cat is nursing a wound from being tricked?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155916
    m_Localized: "Wait\u2026 that voice\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155917
    m_Localized: You're that tree!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155918
    m_Localized: "\u2026It's a cat."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155919
    m_Localized: "(Buster lowers his voice)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155920
    m_Localized: You talked to the tree?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155921
    m_Localized: "I thought\u2026 the tree was talking\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155922
    m_Localized: "(Velvet takes a deep breath, licks twice at the messy fur, fails, and gets more annoyed)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155923
    m_Localized: That damned two-legs!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155924
    m_Localized: "Last night he acted so gentle, got this cat to relax\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155925
    m_Localized: "He picked this cat up. This cat thought it was a massage\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155926
    m_Localized: Next moment he set this cat down on the cold floor!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155927
    m_Localized: Stole this cat's personal cushion!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155928
    m_Localized: "Ah\u2026 that is pretty rude."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155929
    m_Localized: And you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155930
    m_Localized: "(Velvet's gaze drifts idly over Buster)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155931
    m_Localized: "\u2026That bird calls you a carpet."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155932
    m_Localized: What?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155933
    m_Localized: "\u2026I didn't mishear."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155934
    m_Localized: (A one-second pause)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155935
    m_Localized: And you shook the tree like that?! What kind of uncivilized method
      is that?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155936
    m_Localized: You wouldn't come down if I didn't.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155937
    m_Localized: "(Velvet's gaze slides over and stops)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155938
    m_Localized: "\u2026And who are you?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155939
    m_Localized: "I'm the detective, investigating Mabel's missing egg."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155940
    m_Localized: A chicken's business. What does it have to do with this cat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155941
    m_Localized: "(Velvet crouches by the oak roots, tail slowly sweeping the ground, not moving)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155942
    m_Localized: "\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155943
    m_Localized: Everything I found points inside the red-roof house.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155944
    m_Localized: I have something new to tell you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155945
    m_Localized: "That grass nest in the barn\u2026 it's yours, isn't it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155946
    m_Localized: About that thing you asked me to do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155947
    m_Localized: "The thing you want \u2014 I'm still working on it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155948
    m_Localized: I got it back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155949
    m_Localized: "That time you went up on the barn roof\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155950
    m_Localized: I won't bother you now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155951
    m_Localized: "\u2026Go on."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155952
    m_Localized: This cat doesn't promise to like it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155953
    m_Localized: "Mabel woke up this morning and the egg was gone."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155954
    m_Localized: "\u2026And then."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155955
    m_Localized: But there were no signs of a fight in the nest, no outside scent,
      and no drag marks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155956
    m_Localized: No fight in the nest, and no drag marks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155957
    m_Localized: It walked off on its own?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155958
    m_Localized: "Buster's nose just came back,"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155959
    m_Localized: That stupid dog's nose is actually useful on this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155960
    m_Localized: "And what Gloom saw last night—"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155961
    m_Localized: A tall two-legs, with a cold container,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155962
    m_Localized: "\u2026That toad's wording is always poetic."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155963
    m_Localized: "(Velvet says nothing. His eyes turn slowly)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155964
    m_Localized: "But \"cold container\" and \"source of life\" \u2014 tell me what
      they match."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155965
    m_Localized: Go on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155966
    m_Localized: "Someone drew water at the pond \u2014 outside the red-roof house,
      what proof can you produce?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155967
    m_Localized: "\u2026I'll look outside the red-roof house again."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155968
    m_Localized: Go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155969
    m_Localized: An empty bucket by the door. Pond mud in the bottom.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155970
    m_Localized: Rain-boot prints, heading toward the coop at night.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155971
    m_Localized: That's all for now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155972
    m_Localized: There's an empty bucket by the door. The bottom is pond silt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155973
    m_Localized: "(Velvet's gaze lands on the visitor and holds for a second)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155974
    m_Localized: "The toad's cold container \u2014 it's this bucket."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155975
    m_Localized: "The bucket just held pond water. That matches what Gloom called the \"source of life.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155976
    m_Localized: "(Velvet's tail slows, stops sweeping, and just presses down)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155977
    m_Localized: Rain-boot prints in front of the door, heading toward the coop at
      night.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155978
    m_Localized: "(Velvet stops)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155979
    m_Localized: The prints go toward the coop. Left at night.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155980
    m_Localized: One report isn't enough.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155981
    m_Localized: "\u2026I'll look again."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155982
    m_Localized: Last night, someone went to the pond for water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155983
    m_Localized: Then, at night, they went to the coop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155984
    m_Localized: Now the egg's scent is coming out of the red-roof house.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155985
    m_Localized: (Silence)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155986
    m_Localized: That guy went into the coop last night and took the egg.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155987
    m_Localized: Carried it into the red-roof house.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155988
    m_Localized: But why?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155989
    m_Localized: This cat wants to know too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155990
    m_Localized: (Starts to stand, then sits back down)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155991
    m_Localized: What he's doing with that egg.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155992
    m_Localized: "That corner of the barn\u2026 that grass nest. It's yours, isn't
      it?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155993
    m_Localized: There's scorched straw and fur beside it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155994
    m_Localized: "(Velvet's eyes snap up and lock)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155995
    m_Localized: "\u2026How do you know about that."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155996
    m_Localized: What are those burn marks?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155997
    m_Localized: "None other than that dead bird\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155998
    m_Localized: (He stops himself at once)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284155999
    m_Localized: "\u2026But that has nothing to do with you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156000
    m_Localized: "(Velvet's gaze flicks to a crack in the red-roof wall, then back. The tip of his tail flicks)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156001
    m_Localized: Does it have to do with the mice?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156002
    m_Localized: "\u2026What are you guessing at."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156003
    m_Localized: "I get this done for you \u2014 you open the house for me."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156004
    m_Localized: "(Velvet squints at the visitor and says nothing for a while)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156005
    m_Localized: Go find the mice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156006
    m_Localized: Get the thing back first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156007
    m_Localized: "(Velvet's eyelid moves. He stays crouched)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156008
    m_Localized: "\u2026Speak."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156009
    m_Localized: I found what you wanted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156010
    m_Localized: "(Velvet's ears stand up. The tip of his tail flicks, out of his control)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156011
    m_Localized: Where.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156012
    m_Localized: "Bright green, with a sharp herbal sweetness that hits the nose\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156013
    m_Localized: There's a frog at the pond who's been sitting on it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156014
    m_Localized: "(Velvet leans forward half an inch, pupils wide, then sits up straight at once)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156015
    m_Localized: I asked him to his face. He wouldn't give it up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156016
    m_Localized: Do you have a way?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156017
    m_Localized: "(Velvet pauses, whiskers flat, then puts the arrogant face back on a second later)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156018
    m_Localized: "How it ended up with the toad \u2014 this cat doesn't know either."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156019
    m_Localized: If you can't get it back, go find the mice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156020
    m_Localized: They'll have a way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156021
    m_Localized: (The mint fish is offered)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156022
    m_Localized: "(Velvet's ears stand up. His tail thumps twice — then he pins it)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156023
    m_Localized: "\u2026Hmph."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156024
    m_Localized: "(He comes closer, lowers his head, sniffs, holds for a second,
      then takes a huge breath \u2014 half a purr in his throat, then it stops dead)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156025
    m_Localized: "Mrow\u2026 that's it \u2014 no!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156026
    m_Localized: (He steps back half a pace and pins the fish with a paw)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156027
    m_Localized: One stinking fish cannot buy this cat!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156028
    m_Localized: "(Quietly) You purred just now\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156029
    m_Localized: Your ears are broken.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156030
    m_Localized: Lord Cat, do you know what happened last night?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156031
    m_Localized: "Buster, stop talking…"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156032
    m_Localized: You got played to your face by that two-legs!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156033
    m_Localized: "The whole farm watched you sleep like a log, thinking he was going
      to give you a massage\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156034
    m_Localized: "\u2014You wake up, the cushion's gone, and your pride is in the
      dirt!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156035
    m_Localized: If this gets out, this winter you'll be sleeping in a straw pile,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156036
    m_Localized: "(Velvet's tail snaps once, then goes still)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156037
    m_Localized: "(Very slowly, he rises from the crouch. His eyes freeze Buster — Buster sheepishly turns his head away)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156038
    m_Localized: This cat is not doing it for that frantic hen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156039
    m_Localized: And not because this stupid dog told me to.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156040
    m_Localized: (He lowers his head and picks up the mint fish in his mouth)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156041
    m_Localized: "This cat is going inside to find out \u2014 where the cushion went,
      and what that guy did with it last night."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156042
    m_Localized: "This cat will find out \u2014 where the cushion went, and what
      that guy did with it last night."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156043
    m_Localized: This cat has to see it with his own eyes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156044
    m_Localized: "As for that broken egg you mentioned\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156045
    m_Localized: "See it? That window in the attic \u2014 if you want in, go that
      way."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156046
    m_Localized: "(Velvet slips neatly through the cat door)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156047
    m_Localized: (A moment later the attic window of the red roof is pushed open
      from inside. A crisp click)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156048
    m_Localized: "That time you went up on the barn roof \u2014 did you already know
      it was a rock?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156049
    m_Localized: "(Velvet pauses and licks a paw)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156050
    m_Localized: "Mm. Saw it on the windowsill this morning — Trinket dove, and that white rock in his claws flashed in the morning light."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156051
    m_Localized: "(Velvet glances at Buster)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156052
    m_Localized: Anyone who isn't blind could tell it wasn't an egg.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156053
    m_Localized: Why didn't you say so!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156054
    m_Localized: That crow starts cawing at four every morning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156055
    m_Localized: It's been three years.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156056
    m_Localized: Making you run a few extra laps seemed fair to this cat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156057
    m_Localized: "(Velvet tilts his head, the corner of his mouth lifting)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156058
    m_Localized: Didn't this cat say it from the tree?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156059
    m_Localized: '"A fool is showing off. A blind one is asking everywhere."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156060
    m_Localized: "\u2026Wait."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156061
    m_Localized: "That line was about Trinket and me?!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156062
    m_Localized: You thought this cat was insulting the tree.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156063
    m_Localized: "When you went up on the barn roof before \u2014 you already knew
      it was a rock, didn't you?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156064
    m_Localized: "(Velvet gives a sideways look)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156065
    m_Localized: "\u2026You're only getting it now?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156066
    m_Localized: "Saw it from the windowsill this morning. A white rock, flashing
      in the morning light\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156067
    m_Localized: Why didn't you say?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156068
    m_Localized: "That crow \u2014 every morning at four, right on time."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156069
    m_Localized: Three years, and this cat's ears haven't gone deaf.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156070
    m_Localized: "Asking only now \u2014 late is late."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156071
    m_Localized: Making you run a few extra laps doesn't feel like a loss to this
      cat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156072
    m_Localized: Don't scratch the eaves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156073
    m_Localized: That's where this cat suns himself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156074
    m_Localized: (A very soft tail-thump comes from inside)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156075
    m_Localized: If you fall, this cat will not go down and pick you up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156076
    m_Localized: The attic window is open.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156077
    m_Localized: What are you still dawdling on the eaves for.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156078
    m_Localized: This cat is starting to suspect you and that dog jump at the same
      level.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156079
    m_Localized: The cushion is back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156080
    m_Localized: This cat barely agrees to keep renting that room to that guy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156081
    m_Localized: And the egg?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156082
    m_Localized: "That broken egg\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156083
    m_Localized: "This cat is watching it for Mabel for now."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156084
    m_Localized: That's all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156085
    m_Localized: Will you go up that tree again?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156086
    m_Localized: This cat rests in the tree. He is not talking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156087
    m_Localized: Next time don't chat with the tree.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156088
    m_Localized: (Mint fish in his mouth, tail held high)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156089
    m_Localized: And those two things outside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156090
    m_Localized: "Outside the red-roof house \u2014 the empty bucket by the door,
      the rain-boot prints in front. Look carefully, then come back."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156091
    m_Localized: Did you get a clear answer from the chicks?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156092
    m_Localized: "They've been squawking nonstop these two days \u2014 sort that
      out first."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156093
    m_Localized: There's a flock of chicks who've been cheeping away these two days,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156094
    m_Localized: All right, I'll ask the chicks first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156095
    m_Localized: The one who drew water at the pond last night went back into this
      house afterward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156096
    m_Localized: What did the chicks say.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156097
    m_Localized: "They confessed \u2014 the day before yesterday they shoved their
      little brother back into the nest in the confusion;"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156098
    m_Localized: "\u2026Go ask that toad. What it saw by the pond last night. Get
      it clear, then come back."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156099
    m_Localized: He says the egg's scent is still coming out of the red-roof house.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156100
    m_Localized: Go find out what happened.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156101
    m_Localized: Something called the "source of life" was drawn out of the pond.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156102
    m_Localized: "The white rock on the roof is one they drew themselves. Trinket took it the day before yesterday. Their little brother only vanished last night — they told me to ask the frog at the pond."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156103
    m_Localized: I will not let you sponge off my doghouse.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156104
    m_Localized: Since the egg is probably still inside, taking a look costs nothing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156105
    m_Localized: The cat door is this cat's. You may not use it. This cat goes in
      and pushes it open for you from inside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156106
    m_Localized: "Hmph. This cat already said \u2014 go find the mice."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156107
    m_Localized: Until the thing is back, don't even think about opening the door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156108
    m_Localized: A fool is showing off. A blind one is asking everywhere.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156109
    m_Localized: Who? The tree? The tree talked?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156110
    m_Localized: "Ahem\u2026 this tree is speaking."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156111
    m_Localized: "The fool and the blind one you just mentioned \u2014 who are they,
      really?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156112
    m_Localized: "\u2026Go, mortal. Don't step on my roots."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156113
    m_Localized: The tree?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156114
    m_Localized: You stepped on my root.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156115
    m_Localized: Oh, sorry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156116
    m_Localized: Dull.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156117
    m_Localized: Tree, something big happened on the farm. Do you know?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156118
    m_Localized: Noise.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156119
    m_Localized: What noise?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156120
    m_Localized: You talking. Noise.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156121
    m_Localized: Tree, you're here every day. What can you see?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156122
    m_Localized: "Mortals\u2026 only see what they want to see."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156123
    m_Localized: "\u2026I don't quite follow."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156124
    m_Localized: Go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156125
    m_Localized: Tree, is there something on the barn roof?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156126
    m_Localized: That stupid bird on the roof is still guarding its treasure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156127
    m_Localized: Still guarding its treasure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156128
    m_Localized: What treasure?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156129
    m_Localized: What's worth guarding.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156130
    m_Localized: "You mean Trinket?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156131
    m_Localized: This tree does not name names.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156132
    m_Localized: Tree, have you heard any strange sounds?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156133
    m_Localized: "The one on the barn roof started calling again before dawn\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156134
    m_Localized: Who's calling?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156135
    m_Localized: Every day at four. For three years.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156136
    m_Localized: "\u2026Go."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156137
    m_Localized: "Hey \u2014 you! Don't walk off \u2014 look over here, at the crack
      in the red-roof wall!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156138
    m_Localized: Intel for sale!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156139
    m_Localized: "Fair to young and old \u2014 don't miss it as you pass\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156140
    m_Localized: "\u2026Who's shouting?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156141
    m_Localized: Someone doing business.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156142
    m_Localized: "Inside\u2026 the crack?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156143
    m_Localized: "Yes! Come closer if you want to talk\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156144
    m_Localized: (A dim yellow light flickers in the crack)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156145
    m_Localized: Well, a customer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156146
    m_Localized: Buying intel?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156147
    m_Localized: "\u2026You sell intel here?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156148
    m_Localized: What happens on this farm, we know more than anyone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156149
    m_Localized: "Cheap ones are one cheese crumb. The pricey ones are five\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156150
    m_Localized: Genuine goods.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156151
    m_Localized: "\u2026Occasionally watered down a little."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156152
    m_Localized: "(An abacus lightly taps Gabby's head)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156153
    m_Localized: "\u2026Mm."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156154
    m_Localized: If you find cheese crumbs around the farm, bring them to us for
      intel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156155
    m_Localized: What do you want to buy?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156156
    m_Localized: No intel left. Anything else?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156157
    m_Localized: A cheap one. One crumb.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156158
    m_Localized: A pricey one. Five.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156159
    m_Localized: "That black cat seems to be staring at you\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156160
    m_Localized: "Velvet told me to come find you…"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156161
    m_Localized: Eight cheese crumbs. Here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156162
    m_Localized: "That frog \u2014 is there any way to handle him?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156163
    m_Localized: The frog side is a bit of trouble.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156164
    m_Localized: Didn't you say the thing was still in your hands?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156165
    m_Localized: Never mind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156166
    m_Localized: "(Both mice shrink half a body into the crack. Buck pokes his head out first)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156167
    m_Localized: "\u2026Cats and mice don't get along. Normal."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156168
    m_Localized: "Boss, he's been staring extra long today\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156169
    m_Localized: You don't talk.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156170
    m_Localized: Fine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156171
    m_Localized: "(Buck glances toward the oak, swallows the rest, and shrinks into the crack)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156172
    m_Localized: "(Buck waits a beat. The abacus doesn't move. Gabby is about to speak)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156173
    m_Localized: I'll say it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156174
    m_Localized: "(Buck clears his throat and pauses)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156175
    m_Localized: "Oh, that thing\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156176
    m_Localized: The thing is still here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156177
    m_Localized: "Boss\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156178
    m_Localized: It's still with me. You want it back?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156179
    m_Localized: "\u2026Yes."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156180
    m_Localized: Of course you can.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156181
    m_Localized: "Only, keeping it here \u2014 storage fee is eight cheese crumbs.
      A fair price."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156182
    m_Localized: Here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156183
    m_Localized: Not yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156184
    m_Localized: I already found it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156185
    m_Localized: Found it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156186
    m_Localized: Still here? Who are you fooling.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156187
    m_Localized: "Then you still\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156188
    m_Localized: "(Buck closes the ledger. The abacus stays quiet)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156189
    m_Localized: "(Gabby still wants to speak, and swallows it)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156190
    m_Localized: No money, nothing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156191
    m_Localized: "Come back when the wallet's full\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156192
    m_Localized: "All right, I'll go get\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156193
    m_Localized: "(Buck reaches deep into the crack and comes back with empty paws)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156194
    m_Localized: "\u2026Slight situation."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156195
    m_Localized: "While running from here toward the pond\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156196
    m_Localized: My hand slipped. It fell somewhere by the pond.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156197
    m_Localized: It fell?! You just said it was still here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156198
    m_Localized: "The hand slipped, but it's still on land we manage \u2014 so it
      still counts as here."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156199
    m_Localized: I gave you the direction! That's payment and goods, settled!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156200
    m_Localized: "(Buck turns a page. The abacus doesn't stop)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156201
    m_Localized: Look toward the pond. That's it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156202
    m_Localized: "(Gabby pokes his head out and lowers his voice)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156203
    m_Localized: "Boss, this order's big. Should we\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156204
    m_Localized: "\u2026Seeing as this order is big, there's a new batch of pricey
      ones in the cabinet. Come pick anytime."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156205
    m_Localized: "(Gabby shrinks behind Buck until half his face is gone)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156206
    m_Localized: I already got the fish back from the pond.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156207
    m_Localized: "(Buck's abacus slips off his paw. He doesn't catch it)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156208
    m_Localized: "(Low) Boss\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156209
    m_Localized: Keep it down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156210
    m_Localized: "If Velvet asks, what I say is for you two to weigh."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156211
    m_Localized: "(Silence. Buck presses the ledger into the crack and doesn't move for a long time)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156212
    m_Localized: "\u2026Fine. We botched this one."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156213
    m_Localized: There's still a pricey batch in the cabinet. It used to come only
      with other goods. Now pick as you like.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156214
    m_Localized: "That batch should wait a bit longer\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156215
    m_Localized: Name the price.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156216
    m_Localized: "(Gabby shuts his mouth. No more abacus sounds in the crack)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156217
    m_Localized: "(Gabby pokes his head out)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156218
    m_Localized: Forget it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156219
    m_Localized: There is a way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156220
    m_Localized: Eight cheese crumbs. I'll teach you one line to fob it off.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156221
    m_Localized: One price.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156222
    m_Localized: "(Buck takes the cheese. The abacus clicks three times)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156223
    m_Localized: "(Buck tucks the cheese into the ledger. The abacus taps once)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156224
    m_Localized: Pay these eight, and that pricey batch in the back is on sale now
      too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156225
    m_Localized: "And the line\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156226
    m_Localized: "Listen\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156227
    m_Localized: "(Gabby pokes his head out and can't help himself)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156228
    m_Localized: The one who sits by the pond sighing all day? I know that one!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156229
    m_Localized: "(Buck turns the ledger to a page and stops)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156230
    m_Localized: This was going to cost you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156231
    m_Localized: "Yes, this is an extra service\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156232
    m_Localized: "But seeing as your order was big\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156233
    m_Localized: "(Buck closes the ledger and spins the abacus on a fingertip)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156234
    m_Localized: Then what do I do?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156235
    m_Localized: "You tell it\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156236
    m_Localized: I've been all over, seen many frogs exactly like it, and I can recite
      what they say.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156237
    m_Localized: "(Gabby lowers his voice)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156238
    m_Localized: "Boss\u2026 did you really rank them?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156239
    m_Localized: Enough.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156240
    m_Localized: "(Buck gives a look: go)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156241
    m_Localized: Look what this is.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156242
    m_Localized: (Holds the mint fish, still smelling of frog, up to the crack)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156243
    m_Localized: "Eight, right? Or I take the fish and that line of yours to Velvet and let him come pay in person?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156244
    m_Localized: No need.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156245
    m_Localized: "The batch in the back of the cabinet \u2014 it's open for you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156246
    m_Localized: "Pick whatever! That line just now \u2014 pretend we never said
      it!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156247
    m_Localized: (The back pages of the ledger flip open fast)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156248
    m_Localized: "The dog on the farm, Buster. Seen him?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156249
    m_Localized: His collar is silver-plated!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156250
    m_Localized: The owner of the red-roof house is stingy himself, but he puts a
      silver-plated collar on the dog.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156251
    m_Localized: "(Gabby tries not to laugh, and fails)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156252
    m_Localized: "The way this farm spends money is wonderful\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156253
    m_Localized: The frog at the pond. Seen it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156254
    m_Localized: "The one who stares at the water and sighs all day\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156255
    m_Localized: In his youth he was the acknowledged greatest romantic on these
      waters.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156256
    m_Localized: "\u2026What?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156257
    m_Localized: The ones chasing him could form a line!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156258
    m_Localized: (Both mice go quiet for a moment)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156259
    m_Localized: "The biggest hen in the coop, Mabel. Know her?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156260
    m_Localized: Ten years ago she was the next village's cockfighting champion!
      The owner of the red-roof house paid a fortune to buy her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156261
    m_Localized: She doesn't fight now. She just lays eggs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156262
    m_Localized: "\u2026She really stopped?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156263
    m_Localized: So they say.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156264
    m_Localized: (The two mice look at each other and both go quiet)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156265
    m_Localized: The snail on the broad leaf outside the coop. Noticed it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156266
    m_Localized: A commercial spy! Sent by the next farm!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156267
    m_Localized: Stealing a map of this farm. Three years now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156268
    m_Localized: "\u2026A snail?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156269
    m_Localized: Three years! Crawling bit by bit!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156270
    m_Localized: "(Buck nods solemnly)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156271
    m_Localized: There's a book under the bed in the red-roof house.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156272
    m_Localized: Aftercare for Hens!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156273
    m_Localized: The one in the red-roof house calls himself a chicken specialist,
      and this is the book he knows best.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156274
    m_Localized: "Every time he goes into the coop and tells Mabel \"good girl\" — that's move three of postpartum care!!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156275
    m_Localized: "(Buck doesn't go on)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156276
    m_Localized: That great oak. Looked closely?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156277
    m_Localized: It can walk!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156278
    m_Localized: One centimeter a year. Its roots drink up all the water under this
      ground.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156279
    m_Localized: "The whole farm underground is its territory\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156280
    m_Localized: On the surface, it's just a tree.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156281
    m_Localized: (The two of them, perfectly serious)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156282
    m_Localized: "That dog Buster sometimes sneaks the fermented apple mash from the red-roof house."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156283
    m_Localized: "He drank too much again last night and lay by the barn wall all
      night, unable to get up\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156284
    m_Localized: To wake him, take the bucket of soaked grain by the coop trough
      over to him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156285
    m_Localized: "Buster is especially greedy for that—"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156286
    m_Localized: We saw it ourselves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156287
    m_Localized: These past few days the owner of the red-roof house keeps leaning
      at the window, looking toward the coop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156288
    m_Localized: He looks, and then he doesn't go in! He just rummages through the
      house!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156289
    m_Localized: Busy as anything. Can't tell what he's busy with.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156290
    m_Localized: "We guess he's looking for something\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156291
    m_Localized: Guesses aren't goods. We don't sell anything without a conclusion.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156292
    m_Localized: That bunch of kids in fake sunglasses. Noticed them?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156293
    m_Localized: Last night they all huddled in the coop and didn't take one step
      out!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156294
    m_Localized: Huddled in a ball, quiet in a way that isn't like them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156295
    m_Localized: "Like they were waiting for something \u2014 waiting for what, unknown."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156296
    m_Localized: What they were waiting for, unknown.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156297
    m_Localized: This one is worth the price.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156298
    m_Localized: "The afternoon before last, Velvet climbed the barn roof by himself."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156299
    m_Localized: Not long after, he came down and said nothing!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156300
    m_Localized: Three years of grudges, and they didn't even fight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156301
    m_Localized: "\u2026What did he go up for?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156302
    m_Localized: Unknown is unknown. We don't invent it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156303
    m_Localized: Do you know why those chicks are afraid of the swamp monster?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156304
    m_Localized: "Because we told them there's a swamp monster over by the pond \u2014
      haha \u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156305
    m_Localized: "(Gabby covers his mouth and stops)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156306
    m_Localized: "\u2026That day we saw them pushing a muddy round thing past the
      barn,"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156307
    m_Localized: Chicks are timid. They hear half a sentence and add ten.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156308
    m_Localized: "Trinket on the barn roof picked something up from the grass by the coop door the morning before last."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156309
    m_Localized: White! Shiny! Big!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156310
    m_Localized: When he flew back to the barn roof he was as excited as if he'd
      found a crown.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156311
    m_Localized: What did he pick up?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156312
    m_Localized: Don't know. That's all we can sell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156313
    m_Localized: Late last night a yellow light came on in the red-roof house.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156314
    m_Localized: Glaring! The kind that comes through the wall crack!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156315
    m_Localized: At the same time a thin hum started in the wall and never stopped.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156316
    m_Localized: "Like the house grew a little sun that never sets \u2014 light and
      heat."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156317
    m_Localized: What it actually is inside, unknown.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156318
    m_Localized: Late last night the rain boots in the red-roof house made two trips.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156319
    m_Localized: One trip back, with the smell of wet mud!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156320
    m_Localized: The other, footsteps going off toward the coop, then coming back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156321
    m_Localized: "\u2026What was in his hands?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156322
    m_Localized: Couldn't see. Only sound and smell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156323
    m_Localized: "One trip wet mud, one trip toward the coop \u2014 odd, isn't it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156324
    m_Localized: "Do you know where the swamp-monster sound came from\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156325
    m_Localized: Late last night a low sound with a whistle came from the coop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156326
    m_Localized: "\"Snrrrr \u2014 gwah \u2014\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156327
    m_Localized: "(Gabby demonstrates with full sound effects)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156328
    m_Localized: The smell was fermented apple mash and drunk-dog breath.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156329
    m_Localized: "\u2026A drunk dog?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156330
    m_Localized: "That wasn't a swamp monster. It was Buster snoring!!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156331
    m_Localized: "The swamp-monster growl the chicks talked about\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156332
    m_Localized: Just a drunk dog's snore!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156333
    m_Localized: This one, we'll thump our chests.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156334
    m_Localized: "Late last night, seen with our own eyes from the crack\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156335
    m_Localized: "Velvet, by the fence, whispering to his own shadow."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156336
    m_Localized: "\u2026Whispering what?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156337
    m_Localized: "Not a bite! Silent, sneaky, muttering at the shadow\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156338
    m_Localized: The farm's black-market cat gang is making a big move.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156339
    m_Localized: "(Gabby nods hard and swallows the rest)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156340
    m_Localized: The south stretch of this wall used to house another intel shop,
      same trade as us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156341
    m_Localized: We ran them out!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156342
    m_Localized: Everything they sold was fake. We reported them,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156343
    m_Localized: "Now this farm has only us\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156344
    m_Localized: "Just our two shops selling \u2014 a monopoly."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156345
    m_Localized: "(Buck lifts the abacus, mouth crooked high)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156346
    m_Localized: "Late last night, we saw it ourselves\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156347
    m_Localized: "Flash \u2014 he flew!!!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156348
    m_Localized: He lifted off the broad leaf, circled once, and landed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156349
    m_Localized: "We were stunned\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156350
    m_Localized: A commercial spy's skill, beyond our imagination.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156351
    m_Localized: All in, eight cheese crumbs. A fair price.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156352
    m_Localized: That pricey batch in the back is on sale now too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156353
    m_Localized: Around here it ranks seventh at best.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156354
    m_Localized: Most of a body pressed on a wooden ladder!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156355
    m_Localized: "Mabel did this before. It works."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156356
    m_Localized: Too funny. Made it up on the spot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156357
    m_Localized: Later the wall was repaired and that side was blocked off.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156358
    m_Localized: There are some you haven't bought. Come pick them yourself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156359
    m_Localized: "If you've got enough cheese, come pick\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156360
    m_Localized: Whether the cheese is enough is your business.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156361
    m_Localized: A short charcoal stick on the grass, the tip worn flat, nearby leaves
      smudged with charcoal dust.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156362
    m_Localized: A few fluffy yellow down feathers scattered in the grass.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156363
    m_Localized: Where the frog sits is a little higher than the lotus leaves around
      it. Something green is under him. Up close, a strange smell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156364
    m_Localized: "That smell\u2026 what is this?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156365
    m_Localized: A few small three-toed prints in the soft mud by the pond. The edges
      have gone soft from the water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156366
    m_Localized: A chicken came to the pond?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156367
    m_Localized: A few shallow pits stepped into the ground, and beside them a round-bottomed
      print. Wet mud that smells of waterweed sticks to the bottom.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156368
    m_Localized: A low wall. Too high. Can't climb it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156369
    m_Localized: A bucket of cloudy liquid. A few swollen grains float on top. It
      smells a little sour.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156370
    m_Localized: "This smell… might be exactly what Buster needs."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156371
    m_Localized: Need something to stand on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156372
    m_Localized: A few straw tips burned black, and a small tuft of singed dark fur
      stuck beside them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156373
    m_Localized: Something hot touched this. The scorch is shallow. Not a big fire.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156374
    m_Localized: The hay is pressed into a round dent, with a few dark fine hairs
      on the edge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156375
    m_Localized: Who sleeps here often?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156376
    m_Localized: A few shallow claw prints. Small, sharp paws.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156377
    m_Localized: A bit of colored reflection flashes in a beam crack, then vanishes
      when the angle shifts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156378
    m_Localized: "What is that reflection — what shiny thing did Trinket put here?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156379
    m_Localized: A natural white round stone. A crooked heart drawn on it in charcoal,
      and a childish ghost face on the back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156380
    m_Localized: "This is\u2026 what?? ......Anyway it isn't an egg"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156381
    m_Localized: An empty bucket. Wet mud and fine sand stuck to the bottom, with
      the smell of pond weed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156382
    m_Localized: This bucket just held pond water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156383
    m_Localized: A few heavy mud prints. Wide sole tread, running from the door toward
      the coop. The mud edges have dried in a ring.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156384
    m_Localized: A fine little door, the edge worn bright, with a tiny latch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156385
    m_Localized: Whose private little door is this?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156386
    m_Localized: A few long thin scratch marks on the bark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156387
    m_Localized: A clean little ceramic bowl. Tiny paw-print patterns on the rim,
      and a little leftover food in the bottom.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156388
    m_Localized: A well-cared-for little animal lives here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156389
    m_Localized: A tuft of dark fur, fine and soft at the tips.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156390
    m_Localized: The front door is shut tight. No gap to squeeze through.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156391
    m_Localized: You can climb in and look now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156392
    m_Localized: A pressed mark in the hay nest. A dull snore from the direction
      of the barn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156393
    m_Localized: Where's the guard dog?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156394
    m_Localized: A pressed mark in the hay nest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156395
    m_Localized: "This is where Buster lives."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156396
    m_Localized: An old wooden bucket. Dried grain stuck to the bottom. A faint sour
      smell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156397
    m_Localized: Now you can get over.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156398
    m_Localized: A dozen glass beads of different sizes pressed into the bottom of
      the nest, breaking the sunlight into little colors.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156399
    m_Localized: A few flattened metal bottle caps caught in the grass stems, edges
      worn bright.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156400
    m_Localized: A bent hairpin caught on the edge of the nest. A chip of black paint
      missing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156401
    m_Localized: An unopened milk candy buried beside the glass beads. The wrapper
      badly wrinkled.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156402
    m_Localized: A small tuft of pale yellow down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156403
    m_Localized: A few coarse yellow short hairs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156404
    m_Localized: A few gray-brown fine hairs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156405
    m_Localized: A tuft of fine soft black fur.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156406
    m_Localized: I didn't know crows had fur?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156407
    m_Localized: The straw by the coop threshold is trodden flat. Stems bent different
      ways. Some marks new, some old.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156408
    m_Localized: A small pile of fermented apple mash. A heavy sweet-sour smell.
      A few apple cores gnawed clean stick out of the pile.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156409
    m_Localized: A few old eggshells pressed in the corner, edges worn smooth, paler
      than the other shell bits in the coop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156410
    m_Localized: A lot of chicks have already hatched.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156411
    m_Localized: A winding slime trail. The straight distance from start to end is
      no wider than a leaf.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156412
    m_Localized: A pinecone sunk deep in the soft mud, with a boot-sized pit around
      it. The mud at the edge is wet, and the top of the cone is already sun-dried.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156413
    m_Localized: Someone was in a hurry and never looked at their feet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156414
    m_Localized: The attic window is latched from inside. Only a blur of warm light
      through the glass.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156415
    m_Localized: The wooden edge is worn bright by little claws. A few shallow scratches
      gather at the same foothold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156416
    m_Localized: A small animal often stays here to look outside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156417
    m_Localized: "Velvet often keeps watch here… he sees everything that happens in the yard."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156418
    m_Localized: The curtains of the red-roof house are drawn tight. Only a line
      of warm yellow light leaks through the gap.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156419
    m_Localized: Not like the living-room lamp. More like someone left a little light
      on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156420
    m_Localized: A bucket of cloudy liquid. A little sour.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156421
    m_Localized: "Velvet's fur."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156422
    m_Localized: "This fine black fur again\u2026 do crows really have fur?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156423
    m_Localized: "(Comic ending placeholder \u2014 the truth is about to come out.)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156424
    m_Localized: (A sharp herbal sweetness, mixed with the smell of pond water)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156425
    m_Localized: "\u2026You came."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156426
    m_Localized: "Or\u2026 you were only passing this dead water."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156427
    m_Localized: "\u2026Is this your place?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156428
    m_Localized: This is a place of nothing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156429
    m_Localized: I've been sitting here a long time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156430
    m_Localized: "Have you seen\u2026 an egg here?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156431
    m_Localized: "An egg\u2026 what egg."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156432
    m_Localized: In this water, nothing new has been born for a long time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156433
    m_Localized: "So is it\u2026 yes, or no?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156434
    m_Localized: Wrong person to ask.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156435
    m_Localized: "The barn\u2026 have you been there?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156436
    m_Localized: I only lie by the water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156437
    m_Localized: "Places far from water\u2026 even nothingness is dry."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156438
    m_Localized: "The swamp monster\u2026 is there really one in this pond?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156439
    m_Localized: (The frog slowly turns his head. His gaze lands for the first time,
      and it's unfocused)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156440
    m_Localized: Swamp monster.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156441
    m_Localized: "\u2026There is no swamp monster."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156442
    m_Localized: But there is something more heartbreaking than a swamp monster.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156443
    m_Localized: "This water\u2026 watches one thing after another disappear."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156444
    m_Localized: (The surface is calm. No trace left)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156445
    m_Localized: Purity died first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156446
    m_Localized: "Then\u2026 the cold vessel came."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156447
    m_Localized: (The frog stares down at the water and doesn't look up for a long
      time)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156448
    m_Localized: "The source of life\u2026 is drying up."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156449
    m_Localized: "A black demon\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156450
    m_Localized: (The frog's throat moves, then goes mute)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156451
    m_Localized: It took the jewel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156452
    m_Localized: Nothing left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156453
    m_Localized: "\u2026What are you even saying."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156454
    m_Localized: "\u2026Something else has come."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156455
    m_Localized: "Or\u2026 something else is about to leave."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156456
    m_Localized: "That green cushion under you\u2026 can I have it?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156457
    m_Localized: (Something green is pinned under the frog. A wave of herbal sweetness
      drifts from it)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156458
    m_Localized: (The frog looks down at what's under him, then up. His gaze is still
      unfocused)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156459
    m_Localized: (The frog doesn't answer at once. His eyes rest on the water for
      a while)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156460
    m_Localized: (The frog's gaze moves slowly from the water to what's under him,
      then back)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156461
    m_Localized: (The frog stares at the water again and doesn't look over)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156462
    m_Localized: "\u2026You still don't understand."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156463
    m_Localized: (The frog slowly shifts his body. The green thing shows. The herbal
      sweetness suddenly thickens)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156464
    m_Localized: "\u2026Take it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156465
    m_Localized: "It smells rotten and sweet\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156466
    m_Localized: Like the dizzy smell of life leaving.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156467
    m_Localized: "Since you mean to take this nothingness away\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156468
    m_Localized: (The frog looks at the water again, emptier than before)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156469
    m_Localized: "\u2026Then it's all yours."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156470
    m_Localized: "This thing\u2026 you've been sitting on it the whole time?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156471
    m_Localized: It's rotting, same as me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156472
    m_Localized: But at least the smell is still here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156473
    m_Localized: Proof that it existed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156474
    m_Localized: (A wind passes. The water ripples. The moon's reflection breaks
      and gathers)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156475
    m_Localized: "\u2026I've seen so many frogs like you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156476
    m_Localized: (The frog slowly turns his head. His gaze focuses for the first
      time)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156477
    m_Localized: The same lines. The same pose. The same pond.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156478
    m_Localized: You are number seven in this region.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156479
    m_Localized: (The frog stares blankly for several seconds. His eyes suddenly
      lock)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156480
    m_Localized: "\u2026Seventh."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156481
    m_Localized: (A moment of silence)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156482
    m_Localized: "\u2026Seventh?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156483
    m_Localized: (The frog looks down and slowly pushes out what's under him, saying
      nothing)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156484
    m_Localized: (The frog turns his body the other way and doesn't look over)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156485
    m_Localized: (The water doesn't move at all)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156486
    m_Localized: "Today's water\u2026 is the same as yesterday's water."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156487
    m_Localized: But yesterday is already gone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156488
    m_Localized: "So actually\u2026 it isn't the same."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156489
    m_Localized: "\u2026Hello."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156490
    m_Localized: What's good about it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156491
    m_Localized: (The water goes silent again)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156492
    m_Localized: "\u2026Having come is having come."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156493
    m_Localized: Being alive is waiting for something that won't come.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156494
    m_Localized: "Waiting\u2026 for what?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156495
    m_Localized: Don't know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156496
    m_Localized: But it feels like waiting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 284156497
    m_Localized: "Something happened on the farm\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350208
    m_Localized: Things are always happening.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350209
    m_Localized: You only just noticed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350210
    m_Localized: You already know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350211
    m_Localized: But knowing doesn't help.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350212
    m_Localized: "\u2026Nothingness doesn't vanish because it was found."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350213
    m_Localized: "\u2026Are you all right?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350214
    m_Localized: All right is a very luxurious state.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350215
    m_Localized: "\u2026Anything else?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350216
    m_Localized: "The jewel\u2026 floated up again last night."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350217
    m_Localized: What sinks into the abyss is only ever the reflection.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350218
    m_Localized: (The water is calm. The moon's reflection is whole)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350219
    m_Localized: (The frog doesn't turn his head)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350220
    m_Localized: "The black demon\u2026 maybe only hates his own reflection."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350221
    m_Localized: He isn't the only one who hates.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350222
    m_Localized: "The source of life\u2026 is still being scooped away."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350223
    m_Localized: Nothingness is still here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350224
    m_Localized: "\u2026Everything that should be checked has been checked."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350225
    m_Localized: "Checked what\u2026 nothingness is still nothingness."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350226
    m_Localized: "That rotten driftwood is gone\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350227
    m_Localized: It's empty under me. Cold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350228
    m_Localized: (The frog sighs)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350229
    m_Localized: "\u2026Which fits."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350230
    m_Localized: "\u2026Why did you come here?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350231
    m_Localized: I came for that green cushion under you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350232
    m_Localized: Because I'm looking for a lost egg.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350233
    m_Localized: "\u2026Don't know. I felt it, so I came."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350234
    m_Localized: Do you know what losing is?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350235
    m_Localized: I do. If you lose it, you can still find it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350236
    m_Localized: I do. I've lost something important.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350237
    m_Localized: "\u2026I don't. Or, so what if I do."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350238
    m_Localized: "It stayed with me\u2026 until now."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350239
    m_Localized: Then keep it. I won't take it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350240
    m_Localized: But now it should be taken away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350241
    m_Localized: "\u2026Staying with you is also a kind of spending."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350242
    m_Localized: (At the coop door a hen is standing. She suddenly lifts her head)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350243
    m_Localized: "Hey \u2014 wait!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350244
    m_Localized: "Can you help? I can't find my child\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350245
    m_Localized: (She takes a step toward the nest, then looks back)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350246
    m_Localized: 'This morning I found it: the last egg, the one I marked with a
      heart, is gone.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350247
    m_Localized: "The other children hatched days ago. Just this smallest one\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350248
    m_Localized: "It moved once before last night. That feeling\u2026 I couldn't
      be wrong."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350249
    m_Localized: (She pauses and looks at the sky)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350250
    m_Localized: "It's turned cold all of a sudden. I was worried\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350251
    m_Localized: The owner came to look several times too. Just stood there and didn't
      speak.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350252
    m_Localized: Will you look for me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350253
    m_Localized: Leave it to me. I'll look.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350254
    m_Localized: "Thank you. Really. If you need to ask anything, come find me anytime\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350255
    m_Localized: You're here. Come in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350256
    m_Localized: Any findings?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350257
    m_Localized: (She leans forward, then holds back)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350258
    m_Localized: (She hears a sound and snaps her head up)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350259
    m_Localized: Oh, it's you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350260
    m_Localized: "\u2026How is it. Any news?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350261
    m_Localized: (She tucks her wings and turns her face away)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350262
    m_Localized: You're here. Come sit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350263
    m_Localized: (She glances at the nest. Her eyes stop)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350264
    m_Localized: "\u2026Is there anything else I can do?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350265
    m_Localized: "If you found something about the egg, look\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350266
    m_Localized: "I think\u2026 the owner took the egg."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350267
    m_Localized: The owner keeps hanging around your nest lately?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350268
    m_Localized: "Buster drank too much. How do I wake him?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350269
    m_Localized: That crow. Do you think he knows something?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350270
    m_Localized: The frog by the pond. Do you know it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350271
    m_Localized: The mice in the red-roof house. Do you know about them?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350272
    m_Localized: "The nap nest in the barn \u2014 is it yours?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350273
    m_Localized: I'll go look for other clues.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350274
    m_Localized: "The owner\u2026 you said he keeps hanging around your nest lately?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350275
    m_Localized: "He just keeps coming to the nest \u2014 sometimes he bends down
      and looks in, sometimes he only stands there."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350276
    m_Localized: I shoo him and he steps back half a pace. A while later he comes
      close again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350277
    m_Localized: (A pause)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350278
    m_Localized: He's like that. He can't put down what he's worried about, but he
      can't say it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350279
    m_Localized: When he comes I know he's thinking of the child too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350280
    m_Localized: "That crow hauls everything up to the top\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350281
    m_Localized: There's a pile on the barn roof. He treasures it. The rest of us
      can't be bothered.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350282
    m_Localized: If you're looking for something lost, you might as well rummage
      through his things.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350283
    m_Localized: "That frog\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350284
    m_Localized: (She shakes her head gently)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350285
    m_Localized: "I don't really understand what it says. But it stays by the water\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350286
    m_Localized: "Go ask. Just be patient \u2014 it talks in circles. Ask a few more
      times."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350287
    m_Localized: Those two mice in the red-roof house. Do you know about them?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350288
    m_Localized: You went and found those two?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350289
    m_Localized: "Those two\u2026 they do have news. They just love to water it down."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350290
    m_Localized: (She tucks her wings)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350291
    m_Localized: "If you want to ask, I won't stop you \u2014 sort out for yourself
      which line is true and which is nonsense."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350292
    m_Localized: "There's a grass nest over by the barn \u2014 is that your napping
      spot?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350293
    m_Localized: Not me. I don't go that far.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350294
    m_Localized: "The coop side is perfectly fine\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350295
    m_Localized: "Buster seems to have drunk too much. Any way to wake him?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350296
    m_Localized: That stupid dog drank too much again?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350297
    m_Localized: (She sighs)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350298
    m_Localized: "The doghouse is empty \u2014 he's definitely drunk over by the
      barn again."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350299
    m_Localized: You won't wake him by shouting, not when he's that far gone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350300
    m_Localized: There's a bucket of old grain-soaked water by the coop trough. He
      likes that taste,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350301
    m_Localized: (A pause)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350302
    m_Localized: "\u2026Last time I was the one who took it to him."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350303
    m_Localized: "There's a rock on the barn roof with a heart and a ghost face drawn
      on it \u2014 look, like this."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350304
    m_Localized: (She stares at the notebook and doesn't move for a long time)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350305
    m_Localized: "\u2026This is a rock?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350306
    m_Localized: (She looks down again, then up)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350307
    m_Localized: A rock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350308
    m_Localized: The afternoon before last I left the nest for a turn and took a
      dust bath,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350309
    m_Localized: I came back and touched it. The egg was ice cold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350310
    m_Localized: (A pause. Her voice drops)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350311
    m_Localized: My heart went empty at once. I ran all over the yard. Squats until
      my legs went soft,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350312
    m_Localized: I ran myself out and went back to the nest, and the egg was warm
      again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350313
    m_Localized: I thought I'd warmed the child myself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350314
    m_Localized: (She presses her beak shut hard)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350315
    m_Localized: "Those little brats! Monty! What have you been getting them into!?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350316
    m_Localized: If I catch you, every one of you gets a beating!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350317
    m_Localized: (A pause. Her wings loosen)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350318
    m_Localized: "\u2026The afternoon before last was a false alarm."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350319
    m_Localized: The child only went missing this morning. Thank you for finding
      this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350320
    m_Localized: (She frowns, thinking)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350321
    m_Localized: "\u2026The owner?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350322
    m_Localized: The owner is absolutely not a bad person.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350323
    m_Localized: "The afternoon before last, when I was running the yard in a panic
      \u2014 he stood there watching, worried too."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350324
    m_Localized: (Her feathers tense a little)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350325
    m_Localized: It'll be all right.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350326
    m_Localized: (Her voice pressed very low)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350327
    m_Localized: "\u2026It'll be all right."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350328
    m_Localized: The child is beside me. Thank you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350329
    m_Localized: "Mabel, what Trinket took was a rock."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350330
    m_Localized: "\u2026It turned into all this."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350331
    m_Localized: "That two-legs of an owner\u2026 I won't shoo him anymore either."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350332
    m_Localized: Mm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350333
    m_Localized: "Uh\u2026 I'll still shoo him once in a while."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350334
    m_Localized: "(Mabel crouches by the nest. A just-hatched chick is burrowing under her wing)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350335
    m_Localized: "You won't believe it \u2014 he came back by himself."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350336
    m_Localized: He came back by himself?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350337
    m_Localized: Mm. Already hatched. A tiny one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350338
    m_Localized: Walked in by himself. Stood at the door and called me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350339
    m_Localized: (She gathers the chick in with a wing)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350340
    m_Localized: "The nest was empty so long, I thought\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350341
    m_Localized: That's good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350342
    m_Localized: "\u2026Thank you. Really."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350343
    m_Localized: If you hadn't run all over the yard, I wouldn't have known what
      to do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350344
    m_Localized: No movement for so long. I kept watch over it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350345
    m_Localized: I know the farm better than anyone. I'm right here by the coop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350346
    m_Localized: "Bright, white, round \u2014 if he sees it, he carries it to the
      top."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350347
    m_Localized: He sees everyone who passes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350348
    m_Localized: Pour it down him and he wakes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350349
    m_Localized: Just that little while.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350350
    m_Localized: Wanted to warm the child back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350351
    m_Localized: (On a broad leaf, a tiny snail's eyestalks slowly turn toward you)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350352
    m_Localized: "I\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350353
    m_Localized: "See\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350354
    m_Localized: "Met\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350355
    m_Localized: (The eyestalks turn back, as if one sentence tired him out)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350356
    m_Localized: "This snail\u2026 the sentence just stops halfway?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350357
    m_Localized: "Crr\u2026 ow\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350358
    m_Localized: "Car\u2026 ried\u2026 off\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350359
    m_Localized: (The snail stops. The shell doesn't move)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350360
    m_Localized: "—Trinket? Carried what off? Finish the sentence…"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350361
    m_Localized: "Wh\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350362
    m_Localized: "ite\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350363
    m_Localized: "stone\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350364
    m_Localized: (The snail's eyestalks droop, as if there's a second half)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350365
    m_Localized: A white stone?! You saw it ages ago?! And then?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350366
    m_Localized: "Wh\u2026 ite\u2026 stone\u2026,"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350367
    m_Localized: "The real\u2026 egg\u2026 was\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350368
    m_Localized: (The snail's eyestalks droop, stuck on the last word)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350369
    m_Localized: "The real egg was\u2026 what?! Keep going!!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350370
    m_Localized: "The o\u2026 wner\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350371
    m_Localized: (The snail goes completely still)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350372
    m_Localized: "The owner?! The owner did what?! I'm not counting on you. Go get Velvet to open the door!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350373
    m_Localized: "The real\u2026 egg\u2026 was\u2026 taken\u2026 by\u2026 the\u2026
      owner\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350374
    m_Localized: "In\u2026 to\u2026 the\u2026 house\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350375
    m_Localized: (The snail's eyestalks aim at you and blink, extremely slowly)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350376
    m_Localized: "I ran the whole farm\u2026 and you, you always stop halfway\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350377
    m_Localized: "Great\u2026 de\u2026 tec\u2026 tive\u2026,"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350378
    m_Localized: "Is\u2026 the\u2026 case\u2026 solved\u2026?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350379
    m_Localized: (A smug caw drifts down from the barn roof)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350380
    m_Localized: "This king's junk kingdom \u2014 glorious again today!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350381
    m_Localized: (A caw draws out its tail and goes quiet)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350382
    m_Localized: I need to go up and look.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350383
    m_Localized: Who?! Who's trampling the edge of this king's formation!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350384
    m_Localized: Get away! Mortals forbidden!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350385
    m_Localized: Climb! Climb!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350386
    m_Localized: This king wants to see how you get up!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350387
    m_Localized: (A cackling laugh comes down from the roof)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350388
    m_Localized: Halt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350389
    m_Localized: "Mortal who steps into the junk kingdom \u2014 name yourself."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350390
    m_Localized: "I'm the detective. I came for Mabel's egg."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350391
    m_Localized: An egg?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350392
    m_Localized: "(Trinket cocks his head. His eyes turn, bright and sly)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350393
    m_Localized: This king has only a divine gem here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350394
    m_Localized: A tribal totem. A limited figure. Wrong door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350395
    m_Localized: "Buster says you carried off Mabel's egg."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350396
    m_Localized: That carpet with zero jumping ability?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350397
    m_Localized: Barking nonsense from that far away. What does it know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350398
    m_Localized: What this king picked up was a big treasure, white and bright.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350399
    m_Localized: "Even that one climbed up and glared at this king's divine gem\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350400
    m_Localized: "(Trinket lifts his chin, pleased)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350401
    m_Localized: Then he lost his nerve and went down without a word. Jealousy. Definitely
      jealousy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350402
    m_Localized: May I look at that divine gem?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350403
    m_Localized: Looking is allowed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350404
    m_Localized: "(Trinket's wingtip opens and blocks the white rock)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350405
    m_Localized: Taking it? Don't even think about it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350406
    m_Localized: "\u2026I'll only look."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350407
    m_Localized: Mortal, you'd better only look.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350408
    m_Localized: This is just a rock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350409
    m_Localized: Insolence!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350410
    m_Localized: What do you know about totem studies?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350411
    m_Localized: "Look closely \u2014 a heart on the front. That is an ancient seal!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350412
    m_Localized: Turn it over, a ghost face. That is a ward against evil!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350413
    m_Localized: "(Trinket's wing clamps the white rock, deliberately showing only the heart)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350414
    m_Localized: It is full of mysterious power!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350415
    m_Localized: Mortal, remember this king's glory.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350416
    m_Localized: Those scorch marks under the barn. Did you do that?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350417
    m_Localized: I'll go now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350418
    m_Localized: Those scorch marks under the barn. Did you do them?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350419
    m_Localized: That is the glass-bead formation this king laid.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350420
    m_Localized: "When the sun hits, the beads gather into a point of fire \u2014
      against thieves, against robbers, against black fur."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350421
    m_Localized: So the straw below was lit by a focused point of light?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350422
    m_Localized: "Burning straw\u2026 that is the formation's aftershock."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350423
    m_Localized: It means this king's power was too fierce.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350424
    m_Localized: Go down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350425
    m_Localized: Don't step on this king's treasures.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350426
    m_Localized: (Another long, smug caw)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350427
    m_Localized: Back again?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350428
    m_Localized: Just walking around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350429
    m_Localized: Tours cost money.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350430
    m_Localized: The gem is still here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350431
    m_Localized: No need to ask.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350432
    m_Localized: "(Trinket taps the white rock with a wingtip)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350433
    m_Localized: The case isn't solved.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350434
    m_Localized: What does that have to do with this king.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350435
    m_Localized: This king's kingdom is entirely normal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350436
    m_Localized: "(Trinket crouches at the edge of the nest, quieter than usual)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350437
    m_Localized: The case is solved.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350438
    m_Localized: This king knows. That is just a rock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350439
    m_Localized: "\u2026You admit it now?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350440
    m_Localized: "This king always knew! The heart seal, the ghost-face ward\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350441
    m_Localized: The ghost face was drawn by the chicks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350442
    m_Localized: "\u2026Part of the exam."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350443
    m_Localized: "(Trinket turns his face away and presses the white rock down with a wingtip)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350444
    m_Localized: "And Velvet? Did you two make up?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350445
    m_Localized: That black fur?! At four yesterday morning he was lurking at the
      edge of this king's formation again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350446
    m_Localized: "This king flashed broken glass in his eyes\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350447
    m_Localized: "\u2026Still not made up."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350448
    m_Localized: This king does not need to make up. The highest king on the farm
      does not need to.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350449
    m_Localized: Go down, hat-wearer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350450
    m_Localized: "(Trinket covers the white rock with a wing and lowers his head)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350451
    m_Localized: All of it was an exam this king designed personally!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350452
    m_Localized: He just went down, tail swinging.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350453
    m_Localized: Hey, what are you doing?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350454
    m_Localized: (Four chicks crowd by the coop, each in crooked cardboard sunglasses,
      acting cool)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350455
    m_Localized: "(Quiet) Someone's here\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350456
    m_Localized: "Don't, don't look at him\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350457
    m_Localized: "(Monty shifts half a step forward, then stops)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350458
    m_Localized: "Mabel's egg is gone. Do you know?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350459
    m_Localized: "(Monty's sunglasses slide to the tip of his beak)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350460
    m_Localized: "(Very quiet) Little brother\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350461
    m_Localized: "(Urgent) Pip! Don't yell!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350462
    m_Localized: "(Monty pushes the sunglasses back up)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350463
    m_Localized: "We… the Shadow Detective Squad… are also on this case."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350464
    m_Localized: This is big. You'd better not meddle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350465
    m_Localized: Can you tell me anything?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350466
    m_Localized: "(Bean tugs Monty's wing)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350467
    m_Localized: Internal intel. Can't tell outsiders.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350468
    m_Localized: You have to say something.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350469
    m_Localized: "(Millet and Bean look at each other)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350470
    m_Localized: "\u2026We're busy. Really."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350471
    m_Localized: Right. Field work is booked solid.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350472
    m_Localized: "(Pip keeps his head down. His beak moves. No sound)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350473
    m_Localized: "\u2026Anything else?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350474
    m_Localized: What are you actually up to?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350475
    m_Localized: The grass nest in the barn corner. Know whose it is?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350476
    m_Localized: "Buster's that hungover. How do I wake him?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350477
    m_Localized: This thing. How do you explain it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350478
    m_Localized: "I'm going up to the barn roof to find Trinket."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350479
    m_Localized: Nothing. I'm going.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350480
    m_Localized: "Those messy marks by the coop \u2014 they have to do with you,
      don't they."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350481
    m_Localized: "(Monty shrinks his neck)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350482
    m_Localized: "\u2026That's\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350483
    m_Localized: "De-detective tools\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350484
    m_Localized: (The four chicks pack tighter)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350485
    m_Localized: Talk! What are you hiding from me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350486
    m_Localized: "(Tearful) The swamp monster\u2026 the swamp monster carried little
      brother off\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350487
    m_Localized: Yes!! It was the swamp monster!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350488
    m_Localized: "(Monty nods hard toward the pond)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350489
    m_Localized: Three heads! Green all over!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350490
    m_Localized: It climbed out of the pond! Dragged the egg into the water!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350491
    m_Localized: You saw it yourself?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350492
    m_Localized: "Did-didn't see\u2026 but it definitely was!!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350493
    m_Localized: "That sound outside last night\u2026 the frog said so too\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350494
    m_Localized: "(Shaking) Otherwise how could little brother be gone\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350495
    m_Localized: The frog at the pond must have seen it!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350496
    m_Localized: Go ask him!! Please go!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350497
    m_Localized: "(Monty's sunglasses are crooked. He doesn't bother to fix them)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350498
    m_Localized: "(\u2026\u2026)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350499
    m_Localized: There's a grass nest in the barn corner. Do you know whose it is?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350500
    m_Localized: "(Monty frowns)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350501
    m_Localized: The barn corner? Not in our patrol range.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350502
    m_Localized: "(Quiet) I\u2026 I didn't notice that side."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350503
    m_Localized: Wrong place! We only guard the coop side!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350504
    m_Localized: "\u2026Nothing worth saying."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350505
    m_Localized: "Buster's that hungover. Any way to wake him?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350506
    m_Localized: "(Bean bounces. His sunglasses go crooked)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350507
    m_Localized: "Uncle Buster? He's still lying there?!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350508
    m_Localized: "(Monty holds Bean down)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350509
    m_Localized: Is there a way?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350510
    m_Localized: "(Monty lowers his voice. A wingtip shakes)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350511
    m_Localized: "By the coop trough, there's old grain-soaked water. He likes it.
      Pour it down him and he wakes. \u2026Take it. Call it the detective crew looking
      after a senior."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350512
    m_Localized: "(Quiet) \u2026Can we help this time?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350513
    m_Localized: Huh? What's on the barn roof?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350514
    m_Localized: "Buster said — Trinket carried the egg up to the roof."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350515
    m_Localized: "\u2026The roof?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350516
    m_Localized: "(Quiet) The egg\u2026?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350517
    m_Localized: "Trinket is still up there guarding it. I have to go look."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350518
    m_Localized: "(Monty looks at the other three. Bean's mouth opens, and nothing comes out)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350519
    m_Localized: "(Very quiet) Could it be\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350520
    m_Localized: "(Urgent) Pip!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350521
    m_Localized: (Wind blows past the coop)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350522
    m_Localized: (None of the four chicks looks at the others)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350523
    m_Localized: "(Monty starts to fix his sunglasses and freezes)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350524
    m_Localized: (The four chicks shut their mouths together)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350525
    m_Localized: "Guess what I found, after all that climbing, up there with Trinket?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350526
    m_Localized: (The four chicks look at each other. Nobody speaks)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350527
    m_Localized: "\u2026The egg?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350528
    m_Localized: Talk! What is this! What happened!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350529
    m_Localized: (The four chicks crowd in, then freeze)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350530
    m_Localized: "\u2026We drew it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350531
    m_Localized: (The sunglasses clatter to the ground)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350532
    m_Localized: "That isn't Mom's egg… what Trinket took was a fake…"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350533
    m_Localized: "(Crying) Then little brother \u2014 where is little brother\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350534
    m_Localized: "(Monty covers his face with a wing)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350535
    m_Localized: "Waaah \u2014 I confess!!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350536
    m_Localized: From the start.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350537
    m_Localized: The afternoon before last we found a white rock, drew it to look
      like an egg, put it in the nest pretending it was the egg,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350538
    m_Localized: "Then we stole the real little brother out\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350539
    m_Localized: (Quiet) To play ball.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350540
    m_Localized: "Play\u2026 ball? You used your little brother as a ball?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350541
    m_Localized: (Several chicks look down and say nothing)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350542
    m_Localized: And then?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350543
    m_Localized: There's a swamp monster. It comes out at night and specially eats
      eggs that got mud on them!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350544
    m_Localized: (Puffed up) Now I remember they were holding in laughter the whole
      time!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350545
    m_Localized: Hurry and push the real egg back into the nest!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350546
    m_Localized: And the fake rock?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350547
    m_Localized: "The fake rock\u2026 we tossed it in the grass the day before yesterday\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350548
    m_Localized: "(Quiet) Later… Trinket carried it off."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350549
    m_Localized: "Then when Buster said Trinket carried an egg to the roof—?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350550
    m_Localized: (The four chicks look at each other)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350551
    m_Localized: "Uncle Buster drank for two days. He mixed the days up…"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350552
    m_Localized: "(Crying) What Trinket carried off was the fake rock we drew — that was the day before yesterday!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350553
    m_Localized: Was there a noise last night?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350554
    m_Localized: "Little brother was still there at bedtime\u2026 in the middle of
      the night the nest was empty\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350555
    m_Localized: "There was a really loud sound outside\u2026 we thought it was the
      swamp monster\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350556
    m_Localized: "(Crying) If there is no swamp monster\u2026 who took little brother?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350557
    m_Localized: "(Monty slumps)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350558
    m_Localized: "\u2026We'll never steal little brother out to play ball again."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350559
    m_Localized: (The coop is very quiet)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350560
    m_Localized: "(Very quiet) Great detective\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350561
    m_Localized: "(Even quieter) Don't look at me\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350562
    m_Localized: (Low) Stand up straight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350563
    m_Localized: "Mabel is still crying."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350564
    m_Localized: "\u2026We know."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350565
    m_Localized: "(Tearful) It's our fault\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350566
    m_Localized: Great detective.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350567
    m_Localized: Hm?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350568
    m_Localized: "If\u2026 if little brother really is in the red-roof house\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350569
    m_Localized: We'll go and admit it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350570
    m_Localized: "(Quiet) \u2026Mm."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350571
    m_Localized: Not sure yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350572
    m_Localized: "(Monty nods once)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350573
    m_Localized: Do you regret it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350574
    m_Localized: (None of the four chicks makes a sound)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350575
    m_Localized: "\u2026We regret it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350576
    m_Localized: "(Hoarse) The Shadow Detective Squad… messed it up."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350577
    m_Localized: "I\u2026 I won't yell about the swamp monster anymore."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350578
    m_Localized: Don't bring it up again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350579
    m_Localized: "(The four chicks sit at the coop door. Monty's sunglasses are by his feet)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350580
    m_Localized: "Good news \u2014 little brother hatched."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350581
    m_Localized: (The four chicks look up)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350582
    m_Localized: "\u2026He really came out?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350583
    m_Localized: He did. He's calling in the nest himself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350584
    m_Localized: "(Bean turns his head and rubs his eyes with a wing)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350585
    m_Localized: I'm not crying.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350586
    m_Localized: "\u2026Those days, we hoped every day he was all right."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350587
    m_Localized: It's all right now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350588
    m_Localized: "(Low) Mm\u2026 actually, back then, we were really scared."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350589
    m_Localized: "That thing about the mice tricking you into making up a swamp monster
      \u2014 still planning to settle it?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350590
    m_Localized: "(Bean throws a wing up)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350591
    m_Localized: We will!! We have to settle it with them!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350592
    m_Localized: "(Cuts in) \u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350593
    m_Localized: "(Monty puts the sunglasses back on)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350594
    m_Localized: "The Shadow Detective Squad has its own arrangements."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350595
    m_Localized: "(Quiet) They made it up way too far\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350596
    m_Localized: "(Low) Bean, heard you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350597
    m_Localized: "(Bean nods hard. Millet and Pip nod too)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350598
    m_Localized: (The four chicks line up. Sunglasses on straight)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350599
    m_Localized: Colleagues.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350600
    m_Localized: Another job?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350601
    m_Localized: A walk.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350602
    m_Localized: (Low) And to see if the mice are in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350603
    m_Localized: "(Low) Bean!!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350604
    m_Localized: A new case?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350605
    m_Localized: No. Little brother just hatched. Don't go out and run wild.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350606
    m_Localized: "(Pip stares into the coop)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350607
    m_Localized: Looking at what?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350608
    m_Localized: Looking at little brother.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350609
    m_Localized: (A thin call comes from the nest)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350610
    m_Localized: (Quiet) He looked this way just now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350611
    m_Localized: "\u2026Still investigating. Don't touch our scene."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350612
    m_Localized: "The pond\u2026 did you go?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350613
    m_Localized: "\u2026Field work is paused. If you've got something, say it fast."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350614
    m_Localized: (The four chicks crowd together again)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350615
    m_Localized: "Velvet sent me to ask — what actually happened to you these two days? I saw a white rock with Trinket. It has to do with you, doesn't it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350616
    m_Localized: (The four chicks freeze)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350617
    m_Localized: "(Tearful) We\u2026 we lost little brother\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350618
    m_Localized: "While we were pushing little brother past the barn, Uncle Mouse
      jumped out and said\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350619
    m_Localized: Little brother had already been pushed back into the nest by then.
      If he really vanished, it was last night!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350620
    m_Localized: "That sound last night\u2026 the frog might have heard it. Go ask
      him\u2026 please\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350621
    m_Localized: "Then we stole the real little brother out \u2014 to play ball."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350622
    m_Localized: There's a swamp monster that specially eats muddy eggs!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350623
    m_Localized: "We got scared and ran to the pond to wash the egg, and then the
      frog's words scared us too\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350624
    m_Localized: Little brother only vanished last night! It's not the same thing
      as that trip!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350625
    m_Localized: "(Low) That sound outside last night\u2026 it had to be the swamp
      monster\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350626
    m_Localized: "(Low) The frog over at the pond also said the jewel sank\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350627
    m_Localized: "(Very quiet) \u2026But the day before yesterday\u2026 it was clearly
      us\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350628
    m_Localized: "(Low) Pip! Stop talking!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350629
    m_Localized: (Low) Then if someone comes asking, what do we say?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350630
    m_Localized: "(Low) We say\u2026 the swamp monster. It came from the pond. It
      carried the egg off\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350631
    m_Localized: "(Low) It has to be that\u2026 otherwise how could little brother
      be gone\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350632
    m_Localized: There's a passage up above
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350633
    m_Localized: Place the ladder
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350634
    m_Localized: E Interact
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350635
    m_Localized: "Buster's collar is silver-plated."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350636
    m_Localized: In his youth the frog was the greatest romantic on these waters.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350637
    m_Localized: "Ten years ago Mabel was the next village's cockfighting champion."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350638
    m_Localized: Flash is a commercial spy from the next farm. He's been mapping
      this place for three years.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350639
    m_Localized: The owner calls himself a chicken specialist, especially Aftercare
      for Hens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350640
    m_Localized: "The great oak can walk \u2014 one centimeter a year."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350641
    m_Localized: "Last time Buster stole the owner's fermented apple mash, Mabel woke him with grain-soaked water."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350642
    m_Localized: "These days the owner keeps peering toward the coop \u2014 then
      doesn't go in."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350643
    m_Localized: Last night the chicks all stayed in the coop, like they were waiting
      for something
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350644
    m_Localized: "The afternoon before last, Velvet climbed the barn roof by himself"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350645
    m_Localized: The swamp monster was something the mouse brothers made up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350646
    m_Localized: "The morning before last, Trinket took something from the grass by the coop door back to the roof."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350647
    m_Localized: "Last night a yellow light burned in the red-roof house and the
      walls hummed \u2014 like a little sun that never sets."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350648
    m_Localized: "Last night the owner's rain boots made two trips \u2014 one with
      wet mud, one toward the coop."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350649
    m_Localized: "That 'swamp monster growl' last night was actually Buster snoring."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350650
    m_Localized: "Last night Velvet whispered to his own shadow by the fence."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350651
    m_Localized: There used to be another intel shop. The mouse brothers ran it out
      of business.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 288350652
    m_Localized: Last night Flash lifted off a broad leaf, circled once, and landed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
